use ./lib

export test InitCommand:
    expects:
        Piton should have an init command that provides a quick way to set up a
        new project with a piton.config.pi file with a handful of presets.

export test InitAsAPlugin:
    expects:
        The init command should be implemented as a plugin, and the templates
        should be easily editable and extensible by the Piton authors.

export test Templates:
    expects:
        The init command templates should be store in templates/ directory of
        the plugin.
